{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-afeae7f0b77ad719","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Training Operator\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: Training Operator\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n5\t**Owning team**: Distributed Workloads\n6\t**Upstream**: kubeflow/training-operator\n7\t**Midstream**: opendatahub-io/training-operator\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tRuns distributed training jobs (PyTorchJob primarily) on the cluster. Multi-node\n13\tjobs are admitted through Kueue when workload queueing is enabled; the operator\n14\titself performs no scheduling beyond creating pods for the job topology.\n15\t\n16\t## Dependencies\n17\t\n18\t- Kueue (Distributed Workloads) for admission, quota, and gang semantics\n19\t- GPU-enabled worker nodes (NVIDIA GPU Operator) for accelerated training\n20\t\n21\t## Interfaces\n22\t\n23\t- PyTorchJob CRD (kubeflow.org/v1)\n24\t- Workload admission via kueue.x-k8s.io labels/queues\n25\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b0fc9485f8eba266","agent_id":"a81a7a1b3aa452de0","session_id":"1a3bc56e-6837-46b2-9ccd-e7e0a4b10d8c","uuid":"e1baa82c-30bc-4794-a620-f51c223016a1","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:19:02.753Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-afeae7f0b77ad719","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9005"}
