ending vs admitted) of their jobs.\n- Views are project-scoped per the Dashboard's RBAC model.\n- End-to-end validation against a cluster with per-project GPU quotas and queue-based\n  admission enabled: displayed queue position, quota consumption, and admission state\n  match the actual queue state.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): full coverage — queue position, quota consumption, and admission state\n  visible in the Dashboard for pending jobs.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":54455,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b0fc9485f8eba266","agent_id":"a81a7a1b3aa452de0","session_id":"1a3bc56e-6837-46b2-9ccd-e7e0a4b10d8c","uuid":"d7385a3d-f92f-4d0c-8781-11fc9166177f","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:31:59.727Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9005"}
